ion and video extension with expanded resolution and frame length support.\r\n\r\n🔗 Check out our [technical report](https://github.com/hpcaitech/Open-Sora/blob/main/docs/report_04.md) and [gallery](https://hpcaitech.github.io/Open-Sora/) to explore more!","is_prerelease":false},"readme":true,"readme_zh":false,"news":[],"stale":false,"snapshot_at":"2026-11-14T08:50:43Z","history_start":"2026-09-06"}